{"id":"en_love-in-the-twilight-breeze-dubbed","title":"Love in the Twilight Breeze(Dubbed)","titleEn":"Love in the Twilight Breeze(Dubbed)","description":"Approaching forty, Jiang Xiaoyu is desperate to fund treatment for her daughter's leukemia and decides to sell her eggs. A misdial connects her to Jin Hancheng, the hospital director, who feigns a harsh warning to steer her away from the risky plan out of concern for her safety. Their paths then cross in an unexpected way, leading to a passionate night and an unintended pregnancy. To provide for the child she now carries, Jiang Xiaoyu takes work at a nightclub, where she repeatedly comes close to running into Jin Hancheng without actually meeting him, and misunderstandings pile up between them. Convinced she has sunk into a reckless life, he has no idea of the hardships she faces. At the same time, her gambling ex-husband torments and abuses her and her daughter, pushing them to the brink.","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/love-in-the-twilight-breezedubbed/en_US/cf4a25562a758e10/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/love-in-the-twilight-breezedubbed/en_US/cf4a25562a758e10/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Group Pampering","Second Chance","Short Drama"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dv2im/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_love-in-the-twilight-breeze-dubbed_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dv2im/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_love-in-the-twilight-breeze-dubbed_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dv2im/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_love-in-the-twilight-breeze-dubbed_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"